  "title": "Easy Baked Beef Brisket",
  "description": "This foolproof beef brisket recipe bakes in the oven smothered with sliced onions for half the usual amount of time, and still comes out tender and moist.",
  "authors": [
    "John Mitzewich"
  ],
  "date_published": "2019-04-23T00:13:48-04:00",
